  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5802.01 Construction of Terms",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5802.01 Construction of Terms. For the purposes of this rule, the following words and terms have the following meanings when used in the text of the rule. Other technical terms that may be used in the rule in reference to the SAE J1667 test procedure but not defined herein, shall have the meanings defined in the SAE J1667 test procedure.\n\nSource. #6887, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-99",
